$DATUM (+)-Brevisamide (1). (Diacetoxyiodo)benzene (7.4 mg, 23.0 μmol, 1.5
equiv.) in dichloromethane (0.600 mL) was added dropwise to a solution of
substrate 14 (4.8 mg, 14.7 μmol) and TEMPO (1.2 mg, 7.7 μmol, 0.5 equiv.)
in CH2Cl2 (0.600 mL) at rt and was stirred for 2 h. The reaction mixture
was concentrated in vacuo. The residue was purified by column
chromatography (silica, 2.5% methanol - chloroform) delivering
(+)-brevisamide 1 (4.3 mg, 13.3 μmol, 90%). (+)-brevisamide 1 (4.3 mg,
13.3 μmol, 90%). [α]D23 15.5 (c 1.0, MeOH) 1H NMR (500 MHz, CD3OD);
δ(ppm): 10.10 (d, J1=8.5 Hz, 1H); 6.24 (dd, J1=J2=7.5 Hz, 1H); 6.05 (d,
J1=8.5 Hz, 1H); 3.55 (dd, J1=14.5 Hz, J2=3.0 Hz, 1H); 3.46-3.38 (m, 2H);
3.37-3.33 (m, 1H); 3.09 (ddd, J1=9.5 Hz, J2=7.0 Hz, J3=3.0 Hz, 1H); 2.40
- 2.32 (m, 1H); 2.34 (s, 3H); 1.97 (s, 3H); 1.92 (ddd, J1=12.5 Hz, J2=5.0
Hz, J3=2.5 Hz, 1H); 1.88 (s, 3H); 1.87-1.82 (m, 1H); 1.71-1.58 (m, 2H);
1.50-1.42 (m, 1H); 0.98 (d, J1=7.0 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CD3OD);
δ(ppm): 194.5, 173.9, 161.1, 137.4, 137.0, 126.4, 83.2, 80.5, 65.1, 42.7,
41.0, 34.4, 33.3, 27.0, 22.6, 14.7, 14.1, 13.2. LRMS (ESI) calcd for
C18H29NO4Na [M+Na] 346.20, found 346.23.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A Concise Asymmetric Total Synthesis of (+)-Brevisamide
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
