mg, 89%) Rf 0.53 (20% AcOEt in hexane); [α]20 D +22.8 (c 1.25, CHCl3); IR
(thin film) 2957 (s), 2930 (s), 2857 (s), 1721 (s), 1372, 1248 (s); 1H
NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δH 9.59 (1H, s), 7.28 (2H, d, J = 8.5 Hz), 6.88 (2H,
d, J = 8.5 Hz), 6.60 (1H, ddd, J = 16.8, 10.6, 10.6 Hz), 6.03 (1H, dd, J
= 11.0, 11.0 Hz), 5.58 (1H, dd, J = 10.6, 10.6 Hz), 5.22 (1H, d, J = 16.9
Hz), 5.13 (1H, d, J = 10.2 Hz), 4.79 (1H, d, J = 10.6 Hz), 4.57 (1H, d, J
= 10.6 Hz), 4.48 (1H, d, J = 10.6 Hz), 3.80 (3H, s), 3.75 (1H, dd, J =
8.2, 3.5 Hz), 3.43 (1H, dd, J = 4.7, 3.9 Hz), 3.26 (1H, dd, J = 7.5, 3.5
Hz), 3.04-2.98 (1H, m), 2.55-2.46 (2H, m), 2.01 (1H, dd, J = 12.4, 12.4
Hz), 1.85-1.75 (2H, m), 1.63 (1H, app br d, J = 10.6 Hz), 1.54 (3H, s),
1.12 (3H, d, J = 6.8 Hz), 1.06 (3H, d, J = 6.9 Hz), 1.03 (3H, d, J = 6.8
Hz), 0.96 (9H, s), 0.94 (3H, d, J = 6.6 Hz), 0.91 (9H, s), 0.71 (3H, d, J
