$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Iodobenzene diacetate (0.120 g, 0.37 mmol) was added to a solution of
triol 7 (35 mg, 47.2 mmol) in dichloromethane (3.0 mL) and
2,2,6,6-tetramethylpiperidin-1-oxyl (1.0 mg, 6.4 mmol) in dichloromethane
(2.0 mL) at rt. After 2 h 15 min, the solution was directly subjected to
column chromatography (silica, 50% → 60% ethyl acetate/hexanes) to afford
the expected aldehyde (S1)6a,13. Yield (30.7 mg, 41.5 mmol, 88%). [α]23 D
= +17.7 (c 0.94, CH2Cl2). 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ (ppm): 9.44 (s, 1H);
6.27 (s, 1H); 4.83 (s, 1H); 4.78 (s, 1H); 4.44 (d, J = 2.5 Hz, 1H); 4.10-
4.01 (m, 3H); 3.58 (s, 1H); 3.17 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H); 3.10 (bd, J = 11.0
Hz, 1H); 2.57-2.42 (m, 3H); 2.27 (dd, J1=9.0 Hz, J2=3.5 Hz, 1H); 2.22 (m,
23H); 1.43-1.16 (m, 8H); 1.27 (s, 3H); 1.01 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 3H); 0.85 (d,
J = 7.0 Hz, 3H); 0.79 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ
(ppm): 212.6, 192.8, 146.0, 145.2, 143.0, 112.7, 111.4, 109.1, 108.0,
80.2, 77.4, 76.7, 70.5, 69.0, 68.9, 67.5, 56.1, 52.3, 46.2, 44.2, 43.4,
39.6, 39.4, 38.4, 37.2, 36.2, 34.7, 34.0, 32.2, 31.4, 31.2, 30.5, 29.9,
29.6, 26.6, 21.7, 21.6, 19.8, 16.4, 15.9, 12.5. HRMS (ESI): calcd for
C41H61O9N3Na [M + Na] 762.4306, found 762.4281.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Stability of Cyclic Imine Toxins: Interconversion of Pinnatoxin Amino
Ketone and Pinnatoxin A in Aqueous Media
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Jackson, Jeffrey J.; Stivala, Craig E.; Iorga, Bogdan I.; Molgo, Jordi;
Zakarian, Armen
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2012), 77(22), 10435-10440

