$DATUM Aldehyde S37. To a solution of alcohol 4 (35 mg, 12.94 μmol) in
dichloromethane (3.0 ml) was added a solution of
2,2,6,6-tetramethylpiperidine-1-oxyl (1.0 mg, 6.4 μmol) and iodobenzene
diacetate (0.120 g, 0.37 mmol) in dichloromethane (2.0 ml). The solution
was allowed to stir at rt for 2 h and 15 min. The solution was directly
applied on a silica column (silica, 50 → 60% ethyl acetate -hexanes) to
afford S37. (30.7 mg, 41.5 μmol, 88%). [α]D23 +17.7° (c 0.94, CH2Cl2). 1H
NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3); δ (ppm): 9.44 (s, 1H); 6.27 (s, 1H); 4.83 (s, 1H);
4.78 (s, 1H); 4.44 (d, J=2.5 Hz, 1H); 4.11-4.01 (m, 3H); 3.58 (s, 1H);
3.17 (d, J=7.5 Hz, 2H); 3.10 (bd, J=11.0 Hz, 1H); 2.57-2.43 (m, 3H); 2.27
(dd, J1=9.0 Hz, J2=3.5 Hz, 1H); 2.22 (m, 23H); 1.43-1.16 (m, 8H); 1.27
(s, 3H); 1.01 (d, J=7.0 Hz, 3H); 0.85 (d, J=7.0 Hz, 3H); 0.79 (d, J=7.0
Hz, 3H). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3); δ (ppm):212.6, 192.8, 146.0, 145.2,
143.0, 112.7, 111.4, 109.1, 108.0, 80.2, 77.4, 76.7, 70.5, 69.0, 68.9,
67.5, 56.1, 52.3, 46.2, 44.2, 43.4, 39.6, 39.4, 38.4, 37.2, 36.2, 34.7,
34.0, 32.2, 31.4, 31.2, 30.5, 29.6(X2), 26.6, 21.7, 21.6, 19.8, 16.4,
15.9, 12.5. HRMS (ESI) calcd for C41H61O9N3Na [M+Na] 762.4306, found
762.4281.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Total Synthesis of Pinnatoxins A and G and Revision of the Mode of Action
of Pinnatoxin A
