$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Step I. 2,2,6,6- Tetramethyl-1-piperidinyloxyl
TEMPO (30 mg, 0.2 mmol, 0.2 equiv) and [bis(acetoxy)iodo]benzene BAIB
(370 mg, 1.15 mmol, 1.15 equiv) were added to a stirred solution of
specified alkanols (alkanol a-j, 1 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (4 mL), and the
mixture was stirred at rt until complete conversion of alcohol (2-10 h)
checked by TLC or GC/MS.
