$DATUM 2-((2R,6S)-6-(4-methoxyphenyl)tetrahydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)acetaldehyde 14.
TEMPO (22 mg, 0.14 mmol) was added to the solution of
2-((2R,6S)-6-(4-methoxyphenyl)tetrahydro-2H-pyran-2-yl)ethanol (330 mg,
1.4 mmol) and PhI(OAc)2 (547 mg, 1.7 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (5 ml), and the
resulting solution was stirred at rt. for 12 h. After that time the
reaction mixture was diluted with CH2Cl2 (30 ml), washed with Na2S2O3
(aq, satd., 20 ml), NaHCO3 (aq, satd., 20 ml) brine (20 ml), dried with
MgSO4 and subjected to column chromatography (hexane:AcOEt 9:1), yielding
aldehyde 9 as colorless oil (291 mg, 1.24 mmol, 89%). 1H NMR 1.34-1. 44
(m, 1H), 1.47-1.56 (m, 1H), 1.66-1,77 (m, 2H), 1.80-1.86 (m, 1H),
1.93-2.00 (m, 1H), 2.55 (ddd, J= 16.3, 4.9, 2.0, 1H), 2.67 (ddd, J= 16.3,
7.5, 2.6, 1H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 4.01-4.08 (m, 1H), 4.37 (dd, J= 11.3, 2.0,
1H), 6.84-6.88 (m, 2H), 7.23-7.27 (m, 2H), 9.83 (dd, J=2.0, 2.6, 1H); 13C
NMR 23.8, 31.1, 32.9, 50.0, 55.2, 73.6, 79.5, 113.6, 127.0, 135.1, 158.8,
201.7; IR (film) ν: 2936, 2837, 1725, 1613, 1514, 1247, 1080, 1034; HRMS:
(M+MeOH+Na)+ calculated for C15H22O4Na: 289.14103, found: 289.13970,
(M+i-PrOH+Na)+ calculated for C17H26O4Na: 317.1723, found: 317.1714.
