$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Acetoxy aldehyde (+)-59: To a solution of diol (+)-58 (200 mg, 0.25 mmol)
in CH2Cl2 (8 mL) at 25 °C were added PhI(OAc)2 (2.0 equiv, 160 mg, 0.50
mmol) and TEMPO (1.0 equiv, 38 mg, was 0.25 mmol). The reaction mixture
stirred at 25 °C for 48 h and then quenched with saturated aqueous
solutions of Na2S2O3 (2 mL) and NaHCO3 (2 mL). The resulting mixture was
extracted with Et2O (2 x 5 mL), dried (MgSO4), and concentrated under
reduced pressure. The crude residue was purified by flash column
chromatography (silica, EtOAc/hexanes, 2 - 10%) to afford the
corresponding hydroxy aldehyde. To a solution of this hydroxy aldehyde in
CH2Cl2 (10 mL) at 25 °C were added Et3N (30 equiv, 1.07 mL, 7.62 mmol),
4-DMAP (1.0 equiv, 31 mg, 0.25 mmol), and Ac2O (20 equiv, 550 μL, 5.08
mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred for 12 h and then quenched with
saturated aqueous NaHCO3 solution (10 mL). The resulting mixture was
extracted with Et2O (2 x 10 mL), washed with brine (5 mL), dried (MgSO4),
and concentrated under reduced pressure. The crude residue was purified
by flash column chromatography (silica, EtOAc/hexanes, 2 - 5%) to afford
acetoxy aldehyde (+)-59 as a white foam, yield 170 mg, 85% for two steps.
Rf = 0.50 (silica, EtOAc:hexanes, 1:9); [α]25D = +23.4 (c = 1.0, CHCl3);
IR (film): νmax = 2953s, 2875s, 1739s, 1704s, 1458w, 1371s, 1247s, 1064s
cm-1; 1H NMR (C6D6, 600 MHz): δ = 10.44 (s, 1 H), 5.57 (s, 1 H), 5.53 (t,
J = 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.91 (s, 1 H), 4.84 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.82 (s, 1
H), 4.80 (d, J = 6.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.64 (d, J = 3.0 Hz, 1 H), 4.36 (s, 1 H),
4.23 (s, 3 H), 3.74 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 2 H), 2.87 (d, J = 3.6 Hz, 1 H), 2.51
- 2.39 (m, 3 H), 2.19 - 2.12 (m, 3 H), 2.08 (m, 1 H), 1.98 - 1.93 (m, 2
H), 1.93 (m, 2 H), 1.83 (m, 1 H), 1.81 (s, 3 H), 1.73 (m, 1 H), 1.71 (s,
3 H), 1.67 - 1.63 (m, 4 H), 1.55 (m, 1 H), 1.52 (s, 3 H), 1.49 (s, 3 H),
1.48 (s, 3 H), 1.38 (m, 1 H), 1.27 (s, 3 H), 1.23 (t, J = 10.8 Hz, 1 H),
1.12 (t, J = 12.0 Hz, 1 H), 1.03 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 9 H), 0.69 (q, J = 7.8
Hz, 6 H), 0.00 (s, 9 H) ppm; 13C NMR (C6D6, 150 MHz): δ = 199.78, 169.39,
149.39, 143.67, 118.04, 111.23, 98.04, 95.94, 87.23, 76.05, 73.75, 71.71,
71.49, 66.7, 66.28, 58.71, 56.92, 51.37, 50.81, 49.84, 49.66, 46.54,
43.87, 43.30, 32.36, 32.06, 31.06, 29.81, 29.11, 28.21, 25.87, 25.17,
23.83, 22.66, 20.63, 18.48, 7.44, 6.01, -1.34 ppm; HRMS calcd for
C47H78O8Si2H+ [M + H+] 827.5308 found 827.5303.
