$DATUM 2-[4-(3-Formyloxiranyl)but-3-en-1-ynyl]oxazole-4-carboxylic Acid Ethyl
Ester (3) A solution of the above prepared epoxy alcohol (131.6 mg, 0.5
mmol, 1.0 equiv), BAIB [bis(acetoxy)iodobenzene, 177 mg, 0.55 mmol, 1.1
equiv] und TEMPO (8 mg, 0.05 mmol, 0.1 equiv) in CH2Cl2 (1 mL) was
stirred for 2.5 h at r.t. Silica gel was added and the solvent removed.
The crude product was purified by chromatography (EtOAc-PE, 1:2) to
afford aldehyde 3. Colorless solid, yield 106 mg, 81%. Mp 97 °C; [α]D20
-118.2 (c = 0.45, CHCl3). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3/TMS): δ = 9.44 (d, J =
5.2 Hz, 1 H, H- 11), 8.22 (s, 1 H, H-3), 6.36 (dd, J = 15.9, 7.0 Hz, 1 H,
H-8), 6.24 (dd, J = 15.9, 0.6 Hz, 1 H, H-7), 4.40 (q, J = 7.2 Hz, 2 H,
OCH2CH3), 3.86 (ddd, J = 7.0, 4.5, 0.6 Hz, 1 H, H-9), 3.64 (dd, J = 5.3,
4.6 Hz, 1 H, H-10), 1.39 (t, J = 7.2 Hz, 3 H, OCH2CH3). 13C NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3/TMS): δ = 196.75 (CH, C-11), 160.39 (Cq, C-1), 146.57 (Cq, C-4),
144.52 (CH, C-3), 139.01 (CH, C-7/C- 8), 134.70 (Cq, C-2), 114.30 (CH,
C-7/C-8), 88.82 (Cq, C-5/C-6), 78.98 (Cq, C-5/C-6), 61.56 (OCH2CH3),
59.49 (CH, C-9/C-10), 57.34 (CH, C-9/C-10), 14.25 (OCH2CH3). MS-MAT (100
°C): m/z (%) = 262 (24), 261 (100, [M+]), 233 (32), 232 (69), 216 (32),
204 (53), 187 (51), 159 (30), 149 (40), 105 (64). HRMS: m/z calcd for
C13H11NO5: 261.0637; found: 261.0637.
