$DATUM Ethyl (E)-3-(2-Formyl-3,6-dimethoxybenzyloxy)acrylate (7) To a soln of 11
(450 mg, 1.52 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (10 mL) was added PhI(OAc)2 (587 mg, 1.82
mmol) and TEMPO (24 mg, 0.15 mmol) and the mixture was stirred at r.t.
for 5 h. After removal of the solvent in vacuo the remaining residue was
purified by column chromatography (EtOAc-PE, 1:2). 7 (350 mg, 78%) as a
colourless crystalline solid. mp 96-97 °C. IR (neat): 2982, 1709, 1682,
1618, 1483, 1271, 1130, 1006 cm-1. 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 1.26 (t,
J = 7.1 Hz, 3 H), 3.82 (s, 3 H), 3.87 (s, 3 H), 4.15 (q, J = 7.1 Hz, 2
H), 5.29 (s, 2 H), 5.29 (d, J = 12.7 Hz, 1 H), 7.02 (d, J = 9.1 Hz, 1 H),
7.13 (d, J = 9.1 Hz, 1 H), 7.69 (d, J = 12.7 Hz, 1 H), 10.55 (s, 1 H).
13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 14.3, 56.3, 56.7, 59.6, 63.0, 96.7, 113.6,
117.9, 124.0, 124.4, 152.3, 156.9, 162.9, 168.0, 191.9. GC-MS: m/z (%) =
294.1 (M+, 3), 179.1 (100); t R = 33.17 min. HRMS: m/z [M + Na]+ calcd
for C15H18NaO6: 317.0996; found: 317.0996.
