$DATUM To a cold (0 °C) solution of bis-(acetoxy)iodobenzene (44 mg, 0,14 mmol)
and the 1,3-syn-chlorotriol (30 mg, 0.12 mrnol), in CH2Cl2 (1.3 ml), was
added 2,2,6,6-tetramethylpiperidinyloxy (1 mg, cat.) and the reaction
mixture was allowed to gradually warm to room temperature and stirred for
8 hours and the reaction mixture was concentrated under reduced pressure.
Purification of the crude chlorohydrin 21 (dr 1:0.9)14 by flash
chromatography (pentane-EtOAc 6:4).
2-chloro-2-deoxy-4,6-O-isopropylidene-D-altrose as a clear oil, yield 23
mg, 77%. Rf (pentane/EtOAc 1:1) 0.60, 0.48; IR (neat): ν = 3416, 2994,
2919, 1376, 1267, 1197, 1081, 877, 730 cm-1: 1H-NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3): δ =
(21) 5.25 (s, 1H), 4.27 -4.25 (m, 2H), 4.09 (dd, J = 2.3 Hz, J = 9.6 Hz,
1H), 3.94 (dd, J = 4.8 Hz, J = 10.0 Hz, 1H), 3.90-3.85 (m, 1H), 3.82 (dd,
J = 10.0 Hz, 1H), 1.53 (s, 3H), 1.42 ppm (s, 3H); (21'), 5.21 (s, 1H),
4.24-4.16 (m, 4H), 3.94 (dd, J = 4.8 Hz, J = 10.0 Hz, 1H), 3.88 (dd, J =
10.0 Hz, 1H), 1.56 (s, 3H), 1.44 ppm (s, 3H); δ = (OH), 3.38 (Sbr, 1H),
2.52 (Sbr, 1H); 13C-NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3): δ = 100.4, 100.2, 95.1, 90.7,
70.7, 70.5, 67.7, 67.6, 65.4, 62.5, 62.1, 61.9, 59.6, 55.5, 29.0, 28.9,
19.4, 19.3 ppm; HRMS (ESI) m/z calcd for C14H24ClO4Si [M + Na]+ 261.0500,
found 261.0511.
