(7S,8S,E)-7-(Dimethyl(phenyl)silyl)-8-hydroxy-9-methoxy-5-methylnon-5-enal
(13b): Prepared by the general procedure I using silyl diol 3b to provide
silyl aldehyde 13b (128 mg, 77%) as a slightly yellow oil. 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3) δ 0.31 (s, 3H), 0.35 (s, 3H), 1.42 (s, 3H), 1.62 (m, 2H),
1.94 (t, J = 8.0 Hz, 2H), 2.15-2.28 (m, 4H), 3.09 (m, 1H), 3.29 (s, 3H),
3.32 (m, 1H), 3.72 (m, 1H), 4.87 (d, J = 11.6 Hz, 1H), 7.30 (m, 3H), 7.50
(m, 2H), 9.70 (t, J = 1.5 Hz, 1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ -3.2, -2.9,
16.1, 20.3, 33.3, 39.1, 43.1, 58.8, 72.1, 76.8, 122.6, 127.4, 128.7,
133.8, 134.1, 138.4, 202.5 ppm; IR (neat) νmax: 1111, 1255, 1727, 2913
cm-1; [α]20 D = -4.6 (c = 1.7, CH2Cl2); HRMS(CI/NH3) m/z calcd for
C19H30O3SiNa [M + Na]+ 357.1862, found 357.1855.
